# =====================================================================
# .gitignore — Breast Cancer Interpretable ML
# Estrategia: whitelist (todo ignorado excepto lo listado explícitamente)
# =====================================================================

# Ignorar todo por defecto
*

# --- Archivos raíz ---
!.gitignore
!requirements.txt
!README.md

# --- Código fuente ---
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!src/
!src/**

# --- Notebooks (rastreados) ---
!notebooks/
!notebooks/**

# --- Experimentos (rastreados) ---
!Prueba_emmbedings/
!Prueba_emmbedings/**

# --- Reports (rastreados, excepto artefactos grandes) ---
!reports/
!reports/**

# =====================================================================
# EXCLUSIONES dentro de las carpetas rastreadas
# =====================================================================

# Checkpoints de Jupyter
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/**

# Cachés de Python
**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd

# Artefactos generados por entrenamiento (modelos grandes)
notebooks/model/
notebooks/model/**
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.pkl
**/*.bin
**/*.safetensors

# Figuras generadas automáticamente (miles de splines KAN)
notebooks/figures/
notebooks/figures/**

# Artefactos de experimentos locales
Prueba_emmbedings/artifacts/
Prueba_emmbedings/artifacts/**

# Datos brutos y procesados (no subir al repo — ver README.md para descarga)
src/data/
src/data/**

# Entornos virtuales
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env/

# IDEs y editores
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
